1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,500
Bhaiya, ye biscuit ka packet kitne ka?

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,387
10 rupaye ka, behen ji. 10 biscuit hain.

3
00:00:05,687 --> 00:00:06,845
8 ka de do na.

4
00:00:07,145 --> 00:00:09,969
Theek hai. Ye lo, 8 rupaye mein 8 biscuit!

5
00:00:10,269 --> 00:00:11,214
Aur baaki do?

6
00:00:11,514 --> 00:00:14,300
Wo aapki 2 rupaye ki bachat mein gaye!
